              "whyItMatters": "While this is a local dataset analysis, placing the findings in the context of existing knowledge (e.g., typical CIF for similar treatments) can help calibrate expectations and identify potential outliers or errors.",
              "actionableFix": "Add a brief section citing relevant literature on competing risks analyses in similar settings, or note that no comparable data exist. This is optional but recommended for promotion.",
              "reentryPoint": "literature",
              "deterministicVerification": null,
              "confidence": 0.6
            }
